// Veteran variation for CE Restored's Smugglers' Cove adaptation.
{1}{I've survived three wrecks, two mutinies, and one honest job. The honest job was the worst of them.}{I've survived three wrecks, two mutinies, and one honest job. The honest job was the worst of them.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{How long have you lived here?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{3}{Any advice for a newcomer?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{4}{I'll leave you to your memories.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{5}{You old sailor?}{}{-4}{}{10}{}
{6}{What me do here?}{}{-4}{}{20}{}
{7}{Bye.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{10}{Long enough to remember when there were more boats than holes in the roofs. The cove changes hands, but the tide never notices.}{Long enough to remember when there were more boats than holes in the roofs. The cove changes hands, but the tide never notices.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Any advice for a newcomer?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{12}{That's quite a life.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{13}{You tell good story.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{20}{Stay civil, buy Marek a drink if you want a better price, and don't chase strange noises into the woods. The last fellow who did came back in pieces.}{Stay civil, buy Marek a drink if you want a better price, and don't chase strange noises into the woods. The last fellow who did came back in pieces.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{I'll remember that.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{22}{Me stay by town.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
